.TH FL-PANEL 1 "November 2026" "fldesktop 0.1.0" "fldesktop"
.SH NAME
fl-panel \- taskbar of the fldesktop desktop
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBfl-panel\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
Shows the applications button, quick launch buttons, the list of open windows,
volume (wpctl or pactl), battery state, a clock with a calendar and the power menu.
Configured in \fI~/.config/fldesktop/panel.ini\fR: [Panel] QuickLaunch=id;id;... and
[Clock] Format= (strftime format).
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBfl-wm\fR(1), \fBfl-session\fR(1), \fBfl-panel\fR(1)
